          "title": "今日开盘：小幅低开 沪指跌幅0.08%",
          "url": "https://finance.caixin.com/2026-08-18/102475225.html",
          "published": "Tue, 18 Aug 2026 09:29:53 +0800",
          "summary": "<p>财新网08月18日电: 沪指开盘报3979.49点，跌幅0.08%。</p><p>深成指报14692.03点，跌幅0.08%；创业板指报3730.99点，跌幅0.25%；中小板指报9011.37点，涨幅0.10%。</p><p>盘面上，机械设备领涨，石油石化、纺织服饰、基础化工、社会服务、房地产等板块涨幅居前，综合领跌，计算机、有色金属、传媒、医药生物、环保等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，李强强调努力完成全年经济社会发展目标任务；宇树8月19日上市，重塑人形机器人资本市场走向；国家发改委部署加快2026年新型政策性金融工具投放，加大对民间投资项目支持力度；7月房价修复未能继续向二线扩散，沪广深新房价格环比“五连涨”；长鑫科技市值破4万亿，算力赛道迎来资金集中布局；油气发展“十五五”规划发布，锚定能源安全与低碳发展。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-08-18</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101022007\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101022007\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">宇树科技<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688836.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">12.80</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+2.52</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">早知道：7月各线城市房价同比降幅总体继续收窄；宇树科技将于8月19日在科创板上市</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018278\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018278\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">芯原股份<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688521.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">12.56</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+12.56</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">AI算力订单占比升至九成芯原股份上半年营收近翻倍但亏损持续｜财报解读</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101013783\"><div class=\"row-order\">3</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101013783\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">凯中精密<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002823.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">11.75</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+11.75</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">凯中精密：关于终止实施2025年股票期权激励计划暨注销已获授但尚未行权的股票期权的公告</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001917\"><div class=\"row-order\">4</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001917\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">哈尔斯<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002615.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">10.28</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+10.28</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">哈尔斯：关于2026年半年度计提资产减值准备及核销资产的公告</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101020078\"><div class=\"row-order\">5</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101020078\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">南芯科技<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688484.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.45</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">南芯科技公布半年报上半年净利减少136.58%</div></a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"yqzszb-infomation\"><ul><li>今日敏感舆情指数，面向所有A股上市公司，以其前一日9:00至当日9:00的敏感新闻和公告信息为基础，建立模型计算出的0-100的指数，用来表征该上市公司舆情敏感程度的高低。</li><li>本文列举了今日指数最高的5只股票，同时列举了今日指数较昨日的涨跌值，以及时间段内主要的敏感新闻之一。</li><li>获取更多上市公司信息和其他高级服务，请查阅<span><a href=\"http://database.caixin.com\">财新数据通</a></span>。</li><li>本报告基于大数据技术自动计算和生成，不代表财新数据观点。</li></ul></div></div>",
